 preferential issue to Axana Estates LLP and Plutus Investments India; not yet allotted."],"equity_allotments":["**Imagicaaworld Entertainment** — receives the balance 75% subscription of **Rs 129.45 cr** on its 2,34,82,500 warrants at Rs 73.50, completing full conversion with none outstanding.","**Affle 3i** — allots 17,04,324 equity shares to promoter Affle Holdings on warrant conversion at Rs 1,115.25 each, ~Rs 190 cr (our arithmetic); a further USD 14.99 mn tranche awaits currency conversion before allotment.","**Phantom Digital Effects** — allots 4,00,000 equity shares to its promoter on warrant conversion, Rs 9.88 cr.","**Taylormade Renewables** — allots 2,50,000 shares to promoter Neera Gor on conversion of warrants issued in Sep-2025 (Rs 6.24 cr); separately proposes a *new* preferential issue of up to 14 lakh warrants to promoters (~Rs 9.98 cr), subject to a Nov-18 EGM.","**Marco Cables & Conductors** — board approves a *proposed* preferential issue of up to 63 lakh warrants, aggregating ~Rs 20.13 cr (correcting the baseline's Rs 5.03 cr, which was only the 25% upfront payment); subject to shareholder approval.","**ACS Technologies** — receives listing approval for 49,50,495 equity shares (~Rs 20 cr, our arithmetic) issued to non-promoters on conversion of loans.","**Mangal Credit and Fincorp** — allots 25,00,000 convertible equity warrants on a preferential basis (value not disclosed in the text read)."],"m_and_a":["**Sayaji Industries** — sells idle land at Kathwada, Ahmedabad for Rs 73.00 cr via an executed conveyance deed.","**Imagicaaworld Entertainment** — acquires a 50% stake in Mehsana Next Parks, owner-operator of Shanku's Water Park between Ahmedabad and GIFT City (value not disclosed).","**EPL Limited** — receives Observation Letters with NO adverse observations from both BSE and NSE for its scheme to amalgamate Indovida India into the company; SEBI's October 16 comments (ongoing-litigation disclosure, financials not more than 6 months old, etc.) are on record for the shareholder notice.","**Power Finance Corporation / REC** — both receive No-Objection letters from BSE and NSE for the proposed merger of REC into PFC; still subject to NCLT, shareholder and RBI approval.","**GOCL Corporation** — NCLT orders a shareholders'/unsecured-creditors' meeting (24-Nov) on its proposed merger with Hinduja National Power Corporation (deal value not shown in the filing text read).","**CL Educate** — board approves amalgamating wholly-owned subsidiary DEXIT Global into itself; an internal restructuring, no shares issued or valuation required.","**Mid East Portfolio Management** — signs a non-binding MoU for a *proposed* funding arrangement of up to Rs 5 cr with Cher Lifestyle, to fund three new branches; subject to due diligence and definitive agreements.","**Dhampur Bio Organics** — executes Technology Licensing Agreements with Planetary SA (terms/value not disclosed in the text read)."],"capex_core":["**Allied Blenders and Distillers** — commences commercial operations at its Moradabad bottling facility (6 million cases/year), acquired for ~Rs 70 cr and upgraded for ~Rs 40 cr, part of its stated >Rs 600 cr Uttar Pradesh investment.","**Bhansali Engineering Polymers** — pushes back its Rs 200 cr ABS capacity expansion (75,000 to 100,000 TPA) to end-March 2027 from the earlier September 2026 target, citing Gulf War / Russia-Ukraine supply-chain delays to imported equipment.","**Waaree Renewable Technologies** — approves a 35 MWp/25 MWac IPP solar plant at Wardha, Maharashtra (value not disclosed in the filing text read).","**Kwality Pharmaceuticals** — acquires 4 acres of land at Amritsar to build a new injectable and oral-dosage manufacturing facility (value not disclosed; targeted completion Q4 FY28).","**Sahaj Solar Limited** — Outcome of Board Meeting held on October 19, 2026 (filing not read; carried from the baseline).","**Silkflex Polymers (India)** — commences commercial production for in-house manufacturing of textile garment printing inks, part of a capacity expansion (value not disclosed; filing not read in full)."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 56 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Millworks Technologies** — opens a Centre of Excellence for 3D printing with Markforged Holding Corporation at its Bengaluru facility (no deal value; the Rs 153.40 cr in the baseline is FY26 total income from the filing's own About-the-Company text, not a transaction amount).","**Tata Consultancy Services** — expands its BaNCS for Treasury platform to Indian Bank's Colombo branch in Sri Lanka (value not disclosed).","**Uday Jewellery Industries** — outlines a job-work model using customer-supplied gold and a new lightweight plain-gold jewellery line; corporate supply tie-ups remain at a preliminary, non-binding stage.","**Aeroflex Industries** — granted an Indian patent for automatically generating 3D CAD models of braided hose assemblies.","**Natco Pharma** — announces the launch of Carboplatin Injection (generic of Paraplatin) in the U.S. market.","**Akiko Global Services** — estimated consolidated turnover of Rs 29.60 cr in September 2026, up 71% YoY (Rs 17.34 cr); H1 FY27 turnover Rs 151.57 cr, up 240% YoY (Rs 63.08 cr).","**ACME Solar Holdings** — signs a PPA for a 300 MW / 1,200 MWh assured-peak-supply SECI FDRE project at Rs 6/unit."],"distress_risk":["**SecUR Credentials** — board approves an appeal to the Securities Appellate Tribunal against the NSE Delisting Committee's October 9 order.","**Dharan Infra-EPC** — NCLT Mumbai pronounces its order (delivered 16-Oct) admitting Tata Capital Housing Finance's Section 7 insolvency petition against the company, triggering CIRP.","**Punj Lloyd** — Integrated Annual Report for FY 2025-26.","**IBL Finance** — withdraws its ongoing NCD public issue, citing UPI/ASBA banking platform failures that restricted